 rather than relying on the OPENAI_API_KEY or OPENAI_BASE_URL environment variables, since no live endpoint is available. Most reachability-relevant surface is the Jackson-driven request/response model builders (ChatCompletionCreateParams, etc.) — exercising those via direct serialization round-trips, in addition to the fake-HttpClient path, is the main source of meaningful coverage.\",\n      \"risks\": [\n        \"A test generator unfamiliar with the core/transport split may try to construct OpenAIOkHttpClient or call fromEnv(), which doesn't exist in this jar and isn't configured here — leading to a compile failure or an attempted live network call.\",\n        \"jackson-module-kotlin resolves kotlin-reflect transitively for deserializing Kotlin data classes; kotlin-reflect has known friction with GraalVM native-image reflection metadata, which may need extra reachability-metadata entries discovered only once nativeTestCompile/test actually runs.\",\n        \"Local Gradle and Native Image verification remain authoritative — this assessment is based on SDK architecture research, not an actual test run.\"\n      ],\n      \"applied_setup\": [],\n      \"input_evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"name\": \"issue\",\n          \"summary\": \"#8426 Support for com.openai:openai-java-core:4.38.0; label=library-new-request; body_chars=0\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"existing_tests\",\n          \"summary\": \"0 existing test file path(s) included\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"model\": \"sonnet\",\n      \"input_tokens_used\": 32,\n      \"output_tokens_used\": 24043\n    },\n    \"metrics\": {\n      \"input_tokens_used\": 400127,\n      \"cached_input_tokens_used\": 8718848,\n      \"output_tokens_used\": 35391,\n      \"iterations\": 6,\n      \"cost_usd\": 1.4843,\n      \"generated_loc\": 0,\n      \"tested_library_loc\": 0,\n      \"metadata_entries\": 0,\n      \"code_coverage_percent\": 0.0\n    },\n    \"artifacts\": {\n      \"metadata_fi