ort. The generated JaCoCo XML is approximately 64 MB, which likely exhausts the reporting task’s heap. This explains why dynamic-access coverage is unavailable and why the failure metrics contain zero generated LOC/metadata entries and no metadata artifact despite preserved generated files.\n\nInspect:\n- `logs/com.openai:openai-java-core:4.38.0/finalization/generateLibraryStats-2026-10-09T08-27-21-977954Z.log`\n- `logs/com.openai:openai-java-core:4.38.0/gradle/generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport-2026-10-09T07-43-43-107649Z.log`\n- `logs/com.openai:openai-java-core:4.38.0/gradle-test/gradle-test-2026-10-09T08-22-27-336247Z.log`\n- `logs/com.openai:openai-java-core:4.38.0/finalization/checkMetadataFiles-2026-10-09T08-24-49-267892Z.log`\n\nManual next steps:\n1. Check out the preserved branch and rerun `generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport` and `generateLibraryStats` with a larger Gradle heap; profile the report processing if it still fails.\n2. Review the resulting dynamic-access coverage and generated metadata, ensuring the new-library coverage gate is met.\n3. Rerun the coordinate-scoped metadata, style, JVM, and native-image gates before publishing the work.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0d557f789e09adb6016ac8a6f642e087d185f1103ed613c78e\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 8656, "output": 1886, "cacheRead": 126464, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 1369, "totalTokens": 137006, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1791534809486, "responseId": "resp_0d557f789e09adb6016ac8a6da0e8487d18329782fc0c55b91", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": []}
